==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Be careful of burrowing [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemies early on. Once you're settled, it will just a slow slog through the peons for the first minute or so. When you damage the enemy base, the real fun begins and your army will get knocked back. The Zir Zeals will burrow a very long distance and you'll need to have the [[Cat Cannon]] or [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] units in reserve for when they spawn.

Overall, this Outbreaks should be fairly easy, just be careful of Zir Seal trying to attack your base after burrowing.

==='''Chapters 2 & 3'''===
Due to the increased number of Zir Zeals, the main thing you want to do is try to rush the base as fast as possible, as once all five are stacked, you probably won't be able to win other than pushing to the enemy base with all your other cats. Use about the same strategy as in Chapter 1, but deploy any [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] that you may have once the first or second Zir Zeal resurfaces; or, you can use strong yet cheap attackers like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]] to rush down the base as fast as possible before the first or second Zir Zeal resurfaces if you are afraid of getting overwhelmed by them.

